        "text": "= Please generate a Terms of Service and Contract document for Client {{ $json.Name }} from StorryDotTech. The client operates in the {{ $json.Industry }} industry and requires the services of {{ $json['Required Services'] }} starting from {{ $json['Starting Date'] }}. The contract includes:\n\n1. An introduction outlining the purpose of the contract. \n2. The scope of services.\n3. Payment terms.\n4. Obligations of both parties.\n5. Terms and conditions, including liability clauses.\n6. A section for the client's signature.\n\nService Provider is Always: StorryDotTech\nStorryDotTech Owner Name is: Mudasir Tahir\nStorryDotTech Phone Number is: +923000047125\nStorryDotTech email is: info@storry.com\n\nGenerate a contract with full details by yourself cause we didn't edit it, just return a full, clear contract with no other text.",
